# Merge Branches Evidence

This file is intended to hold the real terminal output from merging the
`bug-fix-typo` branch into `main`. This output can only be produced by
running the commands below in your own local clone of the repository — it
cannot be fabricated here.

## COMMANDS TO RUN

```bash
git checkout main
git merge bug-fix-typo
```

## WHAT THE OUTPUT SHOULD SHOW

After running `git merge bug-fix-typo`, your terminal should print a summary
of the merge, which typically includes a line similar to:

```
1 file changed, N insertions(+), N deletions(-)
```

Coursera specifically wants to see confirmation that **1 file was changed**
by the merge. Do not edit or fabricate this line — copy it exactly as your
terminal prints it.

